Average MME per day relative  = 
        Average MME per day 
             / Average MME per day reference
	~	dmnl
	~	The average strength (in MMEs) of opioid prescriptions, relative to the \
		reference (1999) value. This value is used to impact the relative supply \
		available for diversion.
	|

