Base survival probability H OD relative to Rx = 0.991946
	~	dmnl [0.8,1]
	~	[ACAL, ASM, LIT] The base probability of surviving a heroin overdose \
		without life-saving intervention expressed as a fraction of the base \
		probability of surviving an Rx Opioid overdose without life-saving \
		intervention. We use other model-derived estimates for heroin ODs as a \
		guide for the relative rate, and assume the base probability of surviving \
		a heroin OD is no higher than that of an Rx OD, which is separately \
		calibrated. [Source: Cipriano and Zaric 2018; Coffin and Sullivan 2013]
	|

Base survival probability net H OD  = 
