		Degenhardt 2019, Ma 2018, Kelty 2017, Kelty 2018, Morgan 2019, Bahji 2019, \
		Larochelle 2018] Canada: Canadian estimates come from a few single studies \
		with specific populations or outcome definitions: MMT 0.39 for accidental \
		poisoning (Russolillo 2018, people with criminal convictions, BC); 0.78, \
		not significant (Nolan 2015, people who inject drugs, Vancouver); about \
		0.25 MMT and 0.18 Bup from crude drug-related death rates on vs off OAT \
		(Pearce 2020, BC). As they are broadly similar, the US SOURCE value, which \
		draws on more studies, is kept.
