                  - Tx exit in remission HUD[TxT] 
                  - Tx exit with UD HUD[TxT] 
                  - NonOD death HUD in MOUD Tx[TxT] 
                  - Overdose death HUD in MOUD Tx[TxT] , 
             Initial HUD in MOUD Tx[TxT] )
	~	people
	~	Individuals with HUD in MOUD treatment.
	|

HUD no MOUD  = 
        INTEG( Developing HUD no Rx OUD 
                  + Developing HUD with Rx OUD 
                  - Remitting HUD no MOUD Tx 
                  - NonOD death HUD 
                  - Overdose death HUD 
                  + Relapsing to HUD 
                  + SUM ( Tx exit with UD HUD[TxT!] 
                            - Tx engagement HUD[TxT!] ) , 
             Initial HUD )
	~	people [?,800000]
	~	Individuals with HUD not in MOUD treatment.
	|

