Initiating heroin no Rx base=
	8075.93
	~	people/year [40000,100000]
	~	[ACAL, DATA] Number of individuals initiating NDHU with no prior Rx NP use \
		at model initiation. Data is used to define bounds. [US SOURCE: NSDUH \
		RDAS] Calibrated value from Canada_main_MC.out.
