Initiating heroin no Rx net  = 
        Initiating heroin no Rx base 
             * ( 1
                  + RAMP ( Policy change initiating NDHU no Rx 
                            / Policy rampup duration , 
                       Policy activation time , 
                       Policy activation time 
                            + Policy rampup duration ) )
	~	people/year
	~	Number of individuals initiating NDHU with no prior Rx NP use or use \
		disorder, as of model start, after accounting for policy changes starting \
		in 2018. Conceptually, this figure represents the 'base rate' of \
		initiation, similar to base fractional rates in other parts of the model, \
		which is why policy changes for 2018 onwards directly affect it.
	|

Initiating Rx NP diverted  = 
