OD deaths synth excess estimated  = 
        Max ( 0, 
             IMP DATA OD deaths synth with heroin no Rx 
                  + IF THEN ELSE ( Time 
                            < Fentanyl introduction time , 
                       :NA:, 
                       IF THEN ELSE ( Time 
                                 > Total overdose data last time , 
                            :NA:, 
                            IMP DATA OD deaths synth no heroin no Rx 
                                 - Total overdose deaths synth base ) ) )
	~	people/year
	~	The estimated number of overdose deaths occurring after 2013 that involved \
		synthetic opioids that are in excess of those attributable to baseline \
		(pre-2013) use of synthetics. This is an attempt to measure the effect of \
		illegally manufactured fentanyl and its analogs on opioid overdose deaths.
