Overdose death rate Rx OUD no H  = 
        Overdose death rate base Rx OUD 
             + Overdose death rate synth baseline
	~	1/year
	~	Overall rate of overdose death for people with Rx OUD who have not used \
		heroin in the past year.
	|

Overdose death rate Rx OUD with H  = 
        Overdose death rate base Rx OUD
	~	1/year
	~	Overall rate of overdose death for people with Rx OUD who have used heroin \
		in the past year.
	|

Overdose death rate synth baseline  = 
        Overdose rate synth baseline 
             * ( 1
                  - Base survival probability fentanyl OD ) 
             * Probability OD death not averted PWURx NP or OUD
	~	1/year
	~	The baseline (pre-2013) rate of prescription synthetic-involved overdose \
		death for people with Rx OUD, taking into account pre-2013 overdose \
		lethality and probabilities of intervention.
	|

Overdose death rate synth HUD  = 
        Max ( 0, 
             Overdose death rate HUD 
                  - Overdose death rate base HUD )
	~	1/year
