OxyContin withdrawal lag=
	0.25
	~	year
	~	[ASM] Amount of time for the withdrawal of Oxycontin to fully impact the \
		street market for prescription opioids. The withdrawal was immediate, but \
		some people who use and/or sell opioids at the time would have still had \
		some leftover OxyContin for up to 3 months.
