Probability OD witnessed net  = 
        Probability OD witnessed 
             + RAMP ( IF THEN ELSE ( Policy change probability OD witnessed 
                            >= 0, 
                       Policy change probability OD witnessed 
                            * ( 1
                                 - Probability OD witnessed ) , 
                       Policy change probability OD witnessed 
                            * Probability OD witnessed ) 
                       / Policy rampup duration , 
                  Policy activation time , 
