Rx demand for Rx NP  = 
        ( PWURx NP no PY heroin 
             * Rx demand Rx NP ) 
             + ( Nondisordered heroin use 
                  * Fraction of NDHU with Rx avg 
                  * Rx demand NDHU ) 
             + ( Rx OUD no PY heroin no MOUD 
                  * Rx demand Rx OUD no H ) 
             + ( Rx OUD with PY heroin no MOUD 
                  * Rx demand Rx OUD with H ) 
             + ( HUD no MOUD 
                  * Fraction of HUD with Rx OUD or Rx NP avg 
                  * Rx demand HUD with Rx OUD or Rx NP ) 
             + SUM ( ( Rx OUD no heroin by MOUD[TxT!] 
                       * Rx demand Rx OUD no H 
                       * Effect of MOUD Tx on Rx consumption[TxT!] ) 
                       + ( Rx OUD with heroin by MOUD[TxT!] 
                            * Rx demand Rx OUD with H 
                            * Effect of MOUD Tx on Rx consumption[TxT!] ) 
                       + ( HUD by MOUD[TxT!] 
                            * Fraction of HUD with Rx OUD or Rx NP avg 
                            * Rx demand HUD with Rx OUD or Rx NP 
                            * Effect of MOUD Tx on Rx consumption[TxT!] ) )
	~	MME/year
	~	Total MMEs consumed annually by people who use opioids that is diverted \
		from the medical supply. This includes PWURx-NP using their own Rx and is \
		reduced by the fraction of UDs in treatment.
	|

Rx demand for Rx NP reference  = 
        INITIAL( Rx demand for Rx NP  )
	~	MME/year
	~	Total MMEs consumed annually by people who use opioids that is diverted \
		from the medical supply at model start (INITIAL TIME). This includes \
		PWURx-NP using their own Rx and is reduced by the fraction of UDs in \
		treatment.
	|

Rx demand for Rx NP relative  = 
        Rx demand for Rx NP 
             / Rx demand for Rx NP reference
	~	dmnl
