	~	dmnl
	~	Social Influence impact on the development of Rx OUD at model initiation \
		(INITIAL TIME).
	|

SI on developing Rx OUD relative  = 
        XIDZ ( SI on developing Rx OUD current , 
             SI on developing Rx OUD reference , 
             1)
	~	dmnl
	~	Current Social Influence impact on the development of Rx OUD relative to \
		model initiation (INITIAL TIME).
	|

SI on initiating heroin current  = 
        Effective SI NDHU Rx OUD with PY heroin and HUD heroin initiation 
             / Population
	~	dmnl
	~	Current Social Influence impact on the initiation of heroin.
	|

SI on initiating heroin reference  = 
        INITIAL( SI on initiating heroin current  )
	~	dmnl
	~	Social Influence impact on the initiation of heroin use at model \
		initiation (INITIAL TIME).
	|

SI on initiating heroin relative  = 
        SI on initiating heroin current 
             / SI on initiating heroin reference
	~	dmnl
	~	Social Influence impact on the initiation of heroin use relative to model \
		initiation (INITIAL TIME).
	|

SI on initiating Rx NP current  = 
        Effective SI PWURx NP initiation 
             / Population
	~	dmnl
	~	Current Social Influence impact on the initiation of Rx NP use.
	|

SI on initiating Rx NP reference  = 
        INITIAL( SI on initiating Rx NP current  )
	~	dmnl
	~	Social Influence impact on the initiation of Rx NP use at model initiation \
