		initiation (INITIAL TIME).
	|

Social influence coeff developing HUD  = 
        SI on developing HUD relative 
             ^ Social influence strength developing HUD
	~	dmnl
	~	The multiplier effect of social influence on developing HUD.
	|

Social influence coeff developing Rx OUD  = 
        SI on developing Rx OUD relative 
             ^ Social influence strength developing Rx OUD
	~	dmnl
