********************************************************~
	|

HUD DATA=
	IF THEN ELSE (Time <= 2023 , HUD DATA no redefinition, :NA:)
	~	people
	~	IF THEN ELSE(Switch for alternative HUD data=0, IMP DATA HUD ,  HUD DATA alternative \
		)
		
		(1 - Switch for alternative HUD data) * IMP DATA HUD + Switch for alternative HUD \
		data * HUD DATA alternative
		
		Individuals with HUD, calculated from data. [Source: NSDUH adjusted with \
		RAND ratio]
	|

Total NDHU Rx OUD with PY heroin and HUD DATA=
	IF THEN ELSE(Time<=2019, HUD DATA 
	                  + Rx OUD with PY heroin DATA 
	                  + Nondisordered heroin use DATA, :NA:)
	~	people
	~	X IF MISSING ( HUD DATA 
		                  + Rx OUD with PY heroin DATA 
		                  + Nondisordered heroin use DATA , 
		             :NA:)
	|

Nondisordered heroin use DATA=
	IF THEN ELSE (Time <= MaxDataTime , Nondisordered heroin use DATA no redefinition 
	             * OUD redefinition effect, :NA:)
	~	people
	~	IMP DATA NDHU. Used through MaxDataTime (includes the CSUS 2023 survey \
		point); the US model uses these data only through 2019.
	|

IMP DATA Tx point patients OAT MMT:INTERPOLATE:
	~	people
	~	Point in time count of patients receiving methadone OAT, used only for the \
		initial MOUD stocks (2009 value). 2009-2015: backcast from the IQVIA \
		mid-2015 value at 5% per year (IQVIA misses pharmacy-compounded methadone \
		before 2014); from mid-2015: IQVIA monthly patients. Same series as the \
		methadone calibration target and capacity (see Data imported into \
		Vensim.xlsx, sheet MMT backcast). [Source: IQVIA TPT; Ontario and BC \
		ministry data for the growth rate]
	|

Rx OUD with PY heroin DATA=
	IF THEN ELSE (Time <= MaxDataTime , Rx OUD with PY heroin DATA no redefinition 
	             * OUD redefinition effect, :NA:)
	~	people
	~	IMP DATA Rx OUD with PY heroin
	|

Rx OUD all total DATA=
	IMP DATA Rx OUD no PY heroin + Rx OUD with PY heroin DATA
	~	people
	~	X IF MISSING ( IMP DATA Rx OUD no PY heroin 
		                  + Rx OUD with PY heroin DATA , 
		             :NA:)
	|

