Initial HUD in stable remission LIT=
	187652/10
	~	people [350000,?]
	~	[LIT] Number of people in stable remission from HUD at model initiation \
		(INITIAL TIME), with RAND adjustment. [Source: Martins 2017, Hoffman 2019] \
		[Canadian value: starting value only. No Canadian estimate is available, \
		so the US estimate (187,652) was scaled to Canada (divided by 10, close to \
		the Canada/US population ratio of about 0.11) to give a plausible order of \
		magnitude. The initial stock built from this value is multiplied by the \
		calibrated Initial stock correction[HUS] (Canada_main_MC.out), so the \
		starting stock is effectively estimated in calibration rather than fixed \
		by this value.]
