Rx NP redefinition effect=
	1
	             - RAMP ( Rx NP redefinition fixed effect 
	                       / ( 1
	                            + Rx NP redefinition fixed effect ) 
	                       / OneYear , 
	                  Rx NP redefinition time , 
	                  ( Rx NP redefinition time 
	                       + OneYear ) )
	~	dmnl
	~	The magnitude (based on redefinition fixed effect) and timing (redefinition time) of \
		the reduced estimate of misusers due to NSDUH's rewording in 2015 \
		(original NSDUH wording kept).
		Potential mechanism for a change in survey definitions (as with the 2015 \
		NSDUH rewording in the US SOURCE model). Not active in the Canadian \
		version (time = 2100, fixed effect = 1, so the effect stays 1); left in \
		the model in case needed.
	|

