		Potential mechanism for a change in survey definitions (as with the 2015 \
		NSDUH rewording in the US SOURCE model). Not active in the Canadian \
		version (time = 2100, fixed effect = 1, so the effect stays 1); left in \
		the model in case needed.
	|

IMP DATA PWURx NP no PY heroin
	~	people [?,1.1e+07]
	~		|

IMP DATA Rx OUD no PY heroin
	~	people [?,4e+06]
	~	Individuals with Rx OUD and no past year heroin use. [Source: NSDUH]
	|

IMP DATA Rx OUD with PY heroin
	~	people [?,200000]
	~		|

Total heroin initiation DATA := Total heroin initiation RAND HOLD DATA
	~	person/Years
	~		|

Total heroin initiation RAND HOLD DATA
	~	people/year
	~	Individuals initiating heroin use. [US SOURCE: SAMHSA adjusted with RAND]
		HOLD DATA = placeholder for data: no Canadian data are available for this \
		series and its calibration weight is 0 (CalWts_SOURCE_CA.cin), so it is \
		not used in the Canadian version. Kept from the US SOURCE model structure \
		in case Canadian data become available.
	|

Total overdose data last time  = 
        INITIAL( GET DATA LAST TIME ( IMP DATA OD deaths synth no heroin no Rx )  )
	~	year
	~		|

IMP DATA OD deaths heroin no synth
	~	people/year
	~		|

IMP DATA OD deaths Rx no heroin no synth
	~	people/year
	~		|

IMP DATA OD deaths total:RAW:
	~	people/year
	~		|

IMP DATA OD deaths synth with heroin no Rx
	~	people/year
	~	[Source: NVSS]
	|

IMP DATA OD deaths synth no heroin no Rx
	~	people/year
	~	[Source: NVSS]
	|

Total Rx NP initiation HOLD DATA
	~	people/year
	~	Individuals initiating Rx NP use from any source. [Source: SAMHSA]
	|

Total PWURx NP or OUD no PY heroin DATA=
	PWURx NP no PY heroin DATA redef corrected 
	             + IMP DATA Rx OUD no PY heroin
	~	people
	~		|

Noise SD[TSElm]=
	0.03
	~	dmnl
	~	Standard deviation (as a fraction of the simulated value) of the pink \
		noise added to each reported series after NoiseStartTime (RepVar). Default \
		0.03 for all series. For projection runs with prediction intervals, \
		Noise2024.cin sets NoiseStartTime = 2024 and series-specific values equal \
		to the typical misfit between data and model.
	|

IsYear calc[Year]=
	IF THEN ELSE( MIN( INTEGER( Time + 0.0001 ), 2035 ) = Year + 2008, 1, 0 )
	~	dmnl
	~	Selects the noise stream for the current year (Y09 = 2009 ... Y35 = 2035; \
		2036 uses the Y35 stream). Computed from Time because the IsYear data are \
		:NA: in projection years. Year used as a number gives its position (Y09 = \
		1).
	|

